[{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":17,"col":30},"end":{"line":17,"col":38}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `borrowed` is inside a type.\n\nA word describes a whole parameter or the whole result, so it stands in front\nof a parameter of the signature's arrow or in front of its result:\n`join : borrowed List String, String → String`. Move it there, or remove it."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":20,"col":24},"end":{"line":20,"col":29}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `fresh` is inside a type.\n\nA word describes a whole parameter or the whole result, so it stands in front\nof a parameter of the signature's arrow or in front of its result:\n`join : borrowed List String, String → String`. Move it there, or remove it."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":23,"col":26},"end":{"line":23,"col":30}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`once` describes a function parameter, and this parameter's type is not a\nfunction written out.\n\n`once`, `many` and `owned` say how often a function parameter is called and\nwhat it is handed. Write the function type in the signature, as in\n`once (⊤ → a)`, or use a word for a value: `borrowed`, `aliased`, `returned`,\n`escaped`, `consumed` or `unused`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":26,"col":25},"end":{"line":26,"col":29}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`many` describes a function parameter, and this parameter's type is not a\nfunction written out.\n\n`once`, `many` and `owned` say how often a function parameter is called and\nwhat it is handed. Write the function type in the signature, as in\n`once (⊤ → a)`, or use a word for a value: `borrowed`, `aliased`, `returned`,\n`escaped`, `consumed` or `unused`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":29,"col":25},"end":{"line":29,"col":30}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`fresh` describes a result, and this is a parameter.\n\n`fresh`, `exclusive` and `unknown` say what a call returns, so they stand in\nfront of the type after the last `→`. A parameter takes `unused`, `borrowed`,\n`aliased`, `returned`, `escaped` or `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":32,"col":30},"end":{"line":32,"col":38}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`borrowed` describes a parameter, and this is the result.\n\nA result takes `fresh` (with `exclusive`), `escaped` or `unknown`. To say that\nthe result is one of the parameters, write `returned` in front of that\nparameter."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":35,"col":35},"end":{"line":35,"col":43}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `borrowed` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":38,"col":34},"end":{"line":38,"col":42}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `borrowed` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":41,"col":33},"end":{"line":41,"col":41}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `returned` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":44,"col":24},"end":{"line":44,"col":32}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `consumed` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":47,"col":32},"end":{"line":47,"col":36}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `many` cannot hold together with another word written here.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":50,"col":27},"end":{"line":50,"col":32}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `owned` cannot hold together with another word written here.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":53,"col":46},"end":{"line":53,"col":53}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `unknown` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":56,"col":35},"end":{"line":56,"col":44}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `exclusive` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."}]
